Spec: Experimental pending registration handler

Purpose:
  Expose opt-in registration and operation lookup without granting permissions.

Owns:
  ./ControlRegistration.java

References:
  ./ControlRequest.sdd
  ./PendingRegistry.sdd
  ./ManifestContract.sdd

Must:
  Require a host-provided caller scope and stable mutation UUID; reject JSON identity fields.
  Validate parameters and original manifest size before opening storage.
  Advertise only experimental `app.register.pending` in addition to unsupported product capabilities.
  Initialize storage lazily for registration/query only; keep hello available without database access.
